; Constructive lambda divisibility and primality in the concrete pair ring.
; lambda divides (a+b*omega) exactly when integer three divides (a+b).
; The reverse implication constructs the factor; no quotient field, norm,
; primality axiom, unique factorization or PID is assumed.
; These supply cubic cyclotomic prerequisites used by FLT/Three.lean.
(#alias eisenstein = ./eisenstein-defs.lim::eisenstein)
(#alias eisenstein-zero = ./eisenstein-defs.lim::eisenstein-zero)
(#alias eisenstein-one = ./eisenstein-defs.lim::eisenstein-one)
